{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A daemon that keeps "},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the player’s room: each turn, if the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"go"},{"type":"text","text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catches up the same turn and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrival"},{"text":" line trails the room","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line — the companion only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"to"}]},{"text":" the player,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"type":"text","text":" — and the host may "},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to park the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startDaemon(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to resume."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"steals"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrivals"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player ("},{"code":"starts(in:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival on turn one."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"follows","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actor","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor","text":"Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"name","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"}